            <ArticleTitle>Fine tuning the day surgery process.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>39-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review suggests that nurses need to be more knowledgeable when it comes to the assessment of post-operative pain. The authors recommend the employment of a universal pre-operative assessment and discharge protocol, based on the patient's perspective.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
